Our audit logging capabilities include logging of access and every system output, and we have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed. We maintain a data processing register and have a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available, aligned with GDPR Article 28.

For explainability and auditability, our product, Atelier, is grounded in sources, allowing for retrieval trace, audit log, and figure source linking. It supports internal quality control and statutory audit review, ensuring no ungrounded numeric output is produced.

Given these capabilities and experiences, we can ensure compliance with the client's requirements regarding confidentiality, professional secrecy, GDPR compliance, encryption, pseudonymisation, and data hosting on secure infrastructure.
